Hermes Agent (NousResearch/hermes-agent), later commit
------------------------------------------------------

Source:  https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
Commit:  49268ca6728b35296e1cc5f6fba12c6ffd1c7a8b
Used in: server/engine/grok_plan.py — signing in to the user's own Grok subscription with
         xAI's OAuth device code: the shared client id, the scope and the issuer
         (hermes_cli/auth_constants.py), discovery endpoints accepted only over https on
         x.ai (_xai_validate_oauth_endpoint), the device-code polling rules (wait on
         authorization_pending, a longer interval on slow_down, back off on 408 / 429 / 5xx
         and edge-mitigation pages until the code expires; hermes_cli/auth_device_flow.py
         _poll_device_token_generic), refreshing long-lived access tokens up to an hour
         early and short-lived ones two minutes early (_xai_proactive_refresh_skew_seconds),
         and treating HTTP 403 from the token endpoint as an account that xAI won't give
         OAuth access to, with an API key as the way out rather than signing in again
         (refresh_xai_oauth_pure); rewritten in this server's style

